<title>UK: SGZ-Bank sets 500 mln mark seven-year domestic FRN.</title>
<headline>SGZ-Bank sets 500 mln mark seven-year domestic FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following domestic floating</p>
<p>rate issue was announced by joint lead managers DG Bank and</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers Bankhaus AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SGZ-BANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    21.NOV.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +1/16     PAY DATE    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  99.59     FULL FEES   0.20</p>
<p> LISTING    FRANKFURT DENOMS (K) 10	  GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
